1
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:07,966
[beeping]

2
00:00:12,804 --> 00:00:14,139
Hey, so, where's Anzu?

3
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:15,056
#12 LAST STORY!?

4
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,142
[Hijiri] She should have been
out here by now.

5
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:21,229
Huh. I think she was in the break room
last time I saw her.

6
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:24,149
[suspenseful music]

7
00:00:24,232 --> 00:00:25,316
[Anzu] What was that?

8
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:28,403
My head hurts. It feels…

9
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,655
[Anzu gasps]

10
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:32,198
Blood?

11
00:00:34,784 --> 00:00:36,578
I gotta get out of here.

12
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:38,663
[Yukana] You're just like all the others…

13
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:42,792
always in my way.

14
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:44,878
-[door opens]
-[hurried footsteps]

15
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:46,713
[Arisa] Stop!

16
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:48,757
You're not going alone.

17
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:51,634
We should split up.
We'll cover more ground.

18
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:52,802
-Mm-hm.
-Yes.

19
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,096
[Tsuchiya] Mr. Hijiri,
allow me to handle this.

20
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:56,973
You should remain at work.

21
00:00:58,475 --> 00:00:59,726
[door opens]

22
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:00,935
[Arisa pants]

23
00:01:04,814 --> 00:01:06,566
What did you do, Anzu?

24
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:10,278
Without my magic, I'm useless to you.

25
00:01:12,113 --> 00:01:14,991
[Arisa and Tsukasa panting]

26
00:01:15,575 --> 00:01:16,493
[gasps]

27
00:01:17,035 --> 00:01:19,037
[tense music]

28
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,122
[Tsukasa] Hoshino!

29
00:01:22,707 --> 00:01:24,709
You came for me, my love.

30
00:01:25,543 --> 00:01:26,961
[gasps]

31
00:01:27,045 --> 00:01:28,046
Here.

32
00:01:28,963 --> 00:01:29,964
[gasps]

33
00:01:30,548 --> 00:01:32,467
[Tsukasa grunts in pain]

34
00:01:32,550 --> 00:01:33,676
Hm.

35
00:01:34,761 --> 00:01:36,179
[Yukana] Tsukasa…

36
00:01:36,262 --> 00:01:38,848
[breathing heavily]

37
00:01:39,766 --> 00:01:41,893
I understand. Everyone else is in the way.

38
00:01:43,228 --> 00:01:45,313
None of this is any of your fault.

39
00:01:45,396 --> 00:01:46,314
[gasps]

40
00:01:47,148 --> 00:01:50,485
[Anzu] I would have believed you
even when nobody else did.

41
00:01:52,278 --> 00:01:54,781
How dare you! Get away from Hoshino!

42
00:01:54,864 --> 00:01:56,449
-[slaps]
-[knife clangs]

43
00:01:57,242 --> 00:01:58,701
[Tsukasa exhales heavily]

44
00:01:58,785 --> 00:02:02,080
[Yukana] Tsukasa? But why, my love?

45
00:02:02,163 --> 00:02:04,791
Sh-- Shut up! I am not your love!

46
00:02:04,874 --> 00:02:08,378
Everything you put me through!
And now you go after her!

47
00:02:08,878 --> 00:02:12,966
I never wanna see your face
or hear your voice ever again!

48
00:02:13,049 --> 00:02:14,259
Do you understand me?

49
00:02:14,884 --> 00:02:16,678
Get out of my sight!

50
00:02:18,012 --> 00:02:19,722
[Yukana] There's no need
for such silly lies.

51
00:02:19,806 --> 00:02:20,807
[Tsukasa gasps]

52
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:22,851
I understand.

53
00:02:23,434 --> 00:02:26,062
No one else will understand you like I do.

54
00:02:26,646 --> 00:02:30,483
My sweet Tsukasa,
I'll love you every minute of every day

55
00:02:30,567 --> 00:02:32,068
for the rest of my life.

56
00:02:32,152 --> 00:02:33,111
[moans]

57
00:02:33,194 --> 00:02:37,031
[Yukana] The sweet boy I know
wouldn't resort to this kind of violence.

58
00:02:37,115 --> 00:02:39,033
I see now. I need to stay by your side.

59
00:02:39,117 --> 00:02:41,661
You have some bad influences.

60
00:02:42,996 --> 00:02:44,080
Hmm?

61
00:02:44,164 --> 00:02:48,626
We make this perfectly clear.
If you keep trying to get to Kazuki,

62
00:02:49,252 --> 00:02:51,296
you're gonna have to go through me first,

63
00:02:51,963 --> 00:02:54,549
because I will always be right here
by his side!

64
00:02:55,049 --> 00:02:58,386
I will never let you get near him,
no matter what!

65
00:02:58,469 --> 00:03:00,722
[siren wailing]

66
00:03:02,807 --> 00:03:03,683
[Anzu groans]

67
00:03:05,059 --> 00:03:06,519
[officer] Are you the one who called?

68
00:03:06,603 --> 00:03:09,188
[Arisa] Yes! That woman is armed
and is extremely dangerous!

69
00:03:09,272 --> 00:03:12,025
-[officer] Call it in! We need an…
-Hey, hey! Hold on!

70
00:03:12,108 --> 00:03:14,360
[siren fading]

71
00:03:14,444 --> 00:03:17,405
TRAFFIC SAFETY PROGRAM NOW ENFORCED

72
00:03:17,488 --> 00:03:18,573
[approaching footsteps]

73
00:03:18,656 --> 00:03:20,450
[gasps]
You're okay.

74
00:03:21,492 --> 00:03:24,495
Hey, guys!
You didn't all need to wait for me.

75
00:03:25,455 --> 00:03:27,415
Anzu, are you all right?

76
00:03:27,498 --> 00:03:30,418
Yeah, turns out
it was just a little scratch.

77
00:03:30,501 --> 00:03:32,337
-Mm. That's a relief.
-[Saki] That's a relief.

78
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:33,254
[chuckles]

79
00:03:33,338 --> 00:03:34,422
[Tsukasa's dad] Tsukasa.

80
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:38,801
-[Tsukasa's dad clears throat]
-[Tsukasa] Dad, Mom.

81
00:03:42,764 --> 00:03:44,474
Are you Anzu Hoshino?

82
00:03:45,099 --> 00:03:46,142
[Anzu] Yes.

83
00:03:46,226 --> 00:03:49,479
It's my son's fault.
I'm sorry you were involved.

84
00:03:49,562 --> 00:03:51,606
Please accept our sincerest apology.

85
00:03:54,359 --> 00:03:55,485
[breathing nervously]

86
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:59,030
[grunting]

87
00:03:59,113 --> 00:04:01,532
[Tsukasa groans in pain]
Ow, uh…

88
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,369
[Tsukasa's dad] We're all truly sorry.

89
00:04:06,246 --> 00:04:08,289
I understand your parents are out of town.

90
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:12,210
I would like to apologize
to them as well when they return.

91
00:04:13,086 --> 00:04:15,004
For now, you'll have to excuse us.

92
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,798
[groans]

93
00:04:16,881 --> 00:04:19,175
-[Tsukasa's dad] We're leaving.
-[Tsukasa grunts]

94
00:04:19,259 --> 00:04:20,843
Huh? Uh…

95
00:04:22,887 --> 00:04:24,514
[Tsukasa's dad exclaims]

96
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,392
[Anzu] Let's go home, Kazuki.

97
00:04:28,393 --> 00:04:29,435
[grunts]

98
00:04:31,771 --> 00:04:32,897
Hey!

99
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,277
Tsukasa needed your support tonight.

100
00:04:37,777 --> 00:04:40,280
But just like before,
you blamed him for everything.

101
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:42,573
Do you know how hurtful that is?

102
00:04:43,574 --> 00:04:44,742
Aren't you his father?

103
00:04:44,826 --> 00:04:47,161
Of all people, I'd think
you would be the one stepping up

104
00:04:47,245 --> 00:04:48,329
to protect him!

105
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,373
Let's go.

106
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:53,001
[grunts]

107
00:04:53,668 --> 00:04:55,586
[Junta] She's right. We should go.

108
00:04:55,670 --> 00:04:57,505
[groans]
How dare she.

109
00:04:57,588 --> 00:04:59,424
Such disrespectful behavior!

110
00:04:59,507 --> 00:05:00,967
[Arisa laughing]

111
00:05:02,051 --> 00:05:03,136
Stop laughing!

112
00:05:03,219 --> 00:05:04,554
[Tsukasa's mom] Mm, uh…

113
00:05:06,806 --> 00:05:08,933
[Anzu] I told you, Mom, I'm totally fine.

114
00:05:09,767 --> 00:05:12,937
But I can use more cute pics of Momohiki.
Good night.

115
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,356
[door opens]

116
00:05:15,982 --> 00:05:17,942
Mm. So, guess what?

117
00:05:18,026 --> 00:05:20,528
My mom's coming back home.
I tried to tell her

118
00:05:20,611 --> 00:05:23,323
there was nothing to worry about,
but she insisted.

119
00:05:23,406 --> 00:05:24,324
I'm sorry.

120
00:05:27,994 --> 00:05:31,247
Hey, Hoshino, how is it
that you were always saving me?

121
00:05:31,873 --> 00:05:33,583
Huh, I am?

122
00:05:33,666 --> 00:05:34,834
You are.

123
00:05:37,045 --> 00:05:39,047
[soft piano music]

124
00:05:39,964 --> 00:05:40,923
[phone chimes]

125
00:05:43,384 --> 00:05:45,303
[Ayami] Hey, Tsukasa, how you've been?

126
00:05:45,386 --> 00:05:47,221
Did you hear about
the junior high reunion?

127
00:05:47,305 --> 00:05:50,058
You'd better come.
It's been way too long, I miss you.

128
00:05:50,141 --> 00:05:52,477
[girl 1] Where you've been lately?
I miss you.

129
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,936
[girl 2] So, got a girlfriend yet?

130
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,104
[girl 3] Tsukasa, it's me.

131
00:05:57,273 --> 00:05:58,524
[gags]

132
00:06:03,613 --> 00:06:04,530
-Ah…
-Oh…

133
00:06:04,614 --> 00:06:05,948
[phone clatters]

134
00:06:07,450 --> 00:06:10,161
[yelps]
I'm so sorry!

135
00:06:10,953 --> 00:06:13,956
[Tsukasa sighs]
That's a pretty good crack.

136
00:06:14,499 --> 00:06:17,460
I'm so sorry.
Please, let me pay to fix it.

137
00:06:17,543 --> 00:06:19,712
[Tsukasa] You don't have to pay
for the repairs.

138
00:06:20,546 --> 00:06:23,674
Well, then, thanks. Thanks a lot!

139
00:06:24,258 --> 00:06:27,136
I'm sorry, uh, I bumped you! Goodbye!

140
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:28,387
[Anzu wailing]

141
00:06:28,971 --> 00:06:29,847
Uh…

142
00:06:31,099 --> 00:06:31,974
[chuckles softly]

143
00:06:35,269 --> 00:06:37,480
[Anzu grunting]

144
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,482
Huh?

145
00:06:40,942 --> 00:06:42,944
[eerie chuckle]

146
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:48,074
Uh, hey, are you okay?

147
00:06:48,908 --> 00:06:50,868
-[sighs]
-[Makoto] Come on, don't just stand there,

148
00:06:50,952 --> 00:06:54,622
-help her up!
-All good! I'm totally fine!

149
00:06:55,665 --> 00:06:56,791
[doors clank]

150
00:06:56,874 --> 00:06:58,167
[both] One set A.

151
00:06:58,251 --> 00:06:59,502
-Huh?
-Um…

152
00:07:00,169 --> 00:07:01,879
[Anzu groans]

153
00:07:07,176 --> 00:07:08,261
-Hey.
-[shrieks]

154
00:07:09,011 --> 00:07:11,848
[Tsukasa] I get the feeling
she's gonna be just fine.

155
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:16,769
SHUKAN HIGH INDUCTION CEREMONY

156
00:07:16,853 --> 00:07:18,855
Hey! Better hurry, Kazuki's leaving.

157
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:21,774
He's too fast. I gotta catch up with him!

158
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:23,860
[Tsukasa] I'd better go straight home.

159
00:07:26,362 --> 00:07:27,947
-[Rena] Kazuki!
-[Tsukasa] Please just stop.

160
00:07:28,030 --> 00:07:29,282
Leave me alone.

161
00:07:30,575 --> 00:07:32,160
-[thuds]
-[Anzu] Whoa! Sorry!

162
00:07:32,243 --> 00:07:33,911
-[Tsukasa] Huh?
-[Rena] Oh hey, watch out.

163
00:07:33,995 --> 00:07:36,747
-My bad, sorry! In a hurry!
-Uh?

164
00:07:38,708 --> 00:07:42,128
Hey, Kazuki!

165
00:07:43,171 --> 00:07:45,506
[Tsukasa] From the first time
you caught my eye…

166
00:07:47,717 --> 00:07:51,012
Out of respect for my friend,
I can't help.

167
00:07:51,637 --> 00:07:52,930
Thanks for inviting me along.

168
00:07:53,014 --> 00:07:56,934
-[Tsukasa] You've always…
-But you've been a real lifesaver for me.

169
00:07:57,643 --> 00:07:59,812
[Tsukasa] …known exactly
the right thing to say.

170
00:08:01,272 --> 00:08:03,524
You're always saving me.

171
00:08:04,650 --> 00:08:05,985
[phone chimes]

172
00:08:06,569 --> 00:08:08,613
[Anzu] Huh? Yes!

173
00:08:08,696 --> 00:08:12,992
Mom just sent a ton of Momohiki pics!
[squeals]

174
00:08:13,075 --> 00:08:15,620
[Anzu chuckles]
Mwah!

175
00:08:15,703 --> 00:08:17,872
Stop me if you hate this.

176
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:20,791
[Anzu] Uh…

177
00:08:21,375 --> 00:08:23,044
[Tsukasa] Somewhere along the way,

178
00:08:23,127 --> 00:08:25,213
you became really important to me.

179
00:08:28,549 --> 00:08:29,383
[Tsukasa] Thank you.

180
00:08:30,635 --> 00:08:31,469
[Anzu sighs]

181
00:08:32,553 --> 00:08:35,181
[Anzu] But of course!
What are friends for?

182
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:37,266
[tender music]

183
00:08:39,018 --> 00:08:39,977
[sighs]

184
00:08:44,148 --> 00:08:45,983
[yawns]
I'm so thirsty.

185
00:08:46,776 --> 00:08:47,944
Didn't know you were up.

186
00:08:48,027 --> 00:08:49,278
[door squeaks]

187
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:55,243
-[thuds]
-[Junta groans]

188
00:08:55,326 --> 00:08:57,828
[sobs]
Sorry, I interrupted!

189
00:08:57,912 --> 00:08:59,205
It's not like that!

190
00:09:00,081 --> 00:09:02,208
[Miyoko] My little Anzu!

191
00:09:02,291 --> 00:09:05,545
I know you don't always act like it,
but you are a girl.

192
00:09:05,628 --> 00:09:08,089
You can't afford to have
a scar on your face.

193
00:09:08,172 --> 00:09:11,217
Now it's gonna be even harder for you
to attract your soulmate.

194
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,677
-[Anzu] Mom, stop it.
-[whines]

195
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,428
[Arisa] There's no need
to worry about that.

196
00:09:14,512 --> 00:09:16,305
A true soulmate can see past your scars.

197
00:09:16,389 --> 00:09:19,600
Besides, she practically proposed
to Tsukasa already.

198
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:20,518
Arisa!

199
00:09:21,018 --> 00:09:22,562
I will always be at his side!

200
00:09:22,645 --> 00:09:23,563
Ooh!

201
00:09:23,646 --> 00:09:25,856
You've got the wrong idea!
I didn't mean it like that!

202
00:09:26,732 --> 00:09:28,484
Speaking of boys, where's Junta?

203
00:09:28,568 --> 00:09:29,569
[Anzu] Baseball practice.

204
00:09:29,652 --> 00:09:32,738
[Miyoko] I haven't seen him in a while.
I was looking forward to catching up.

205
00:09:32,822 --> 00:09:35,283
Well, speaking of catching up,
did Dad come too?

206
00:09:35,366 --> 00:09:38,578
[Miyoko] Someone has to stay and take care
of Momohiki. He drew the short straw.

207
00:09:38,661 --> 00:09:40,079
You just left him, huh?

208
00:09:42,498 --> 00:09:45,042
I'm really curious.
How will they punish her?

209
00:09:45,710 --> 00:09:47,503
The authorities need to do something.

210
00:09:47,587 --> 00:09:50,673
This whole situation
has become such a nightmare.

211
00:09:51,299 --> 00:09:52,550
[Arisa] It's just so concerning

212
00:09:52,633 --> 00:09:56,178
because I know how persistent
that girl has always been in the past.

213
00:10:03,311 --> 00:10:05,688
What do you mean you can't cover
for her anymore?

214
00:10:05,771 --> 00:10:07,732
What are we supposed to do?

215
00:10:07,815 --> 00:10:10,234
[Yukana's uncle]
I've said all I can about it.

216
00:10:10,318 --> 00:10:12,570
-[hangs up]
-[Yukana's mom] Wait! Hello?

217
00:10:13,904 --> 00:10:14,780
[sighs]

218
00:10:15,656 --> 00:10:19,452
[Yukana's uncle] Again, I'm terribly sorry
for the trouble my niece has caused.

219
00:10:19,952 --> 00:10:20,870
It's fine.

220
00:10:21,454 --> 00:10:24,582
However, if she attempts
to hurt my friends again…

221
00:10:26,083 --> 00:10:27,835
Do we understand each other?

222
00:10:27,918 --> 00:10:29,920
[suspenseful music]

223
00:10:31,547 --> 00:10:33,007
[Riri] Attaboy, Hijiri.

224
00:10:33,507 --> 00:10:36,552
Way to go, putting
those family connections to good use.

225
00:10:36,636 --> 00:10:38,137
I was counting on you.

226
00:10:39,221 --> 00:10:43,476
Unfortunately, I don't think
this punishment is gonna cut it.

227
00:10:49,523 --> 00:10:50,441
[water plops]

228
00:10:51,484 --> 00:10:53,903
[Yukana] Separated from my love
once again.

229
00:10:55,029 --> 00:10:56,614
But do not fear, my sweet.

230
00:10:57,156 --> 00:10:59,492
We are destined to be together.

231
00:11:00,534 --> 00:11:03,412
I am the only one who can save you
from all those people,

232
00:11:03,996 --> 00:11:05,539
who want to keep us apart.

233
00:11:05,623 --> 00:11:07,416
-[Riri] Good evening.
-[gasps]

234
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,417
Huh?

235
00:11:09,168 --> 00:11:10,086
Who are you?

236
00:11:11,712 --> 00:11:14,924
Well, hey there! The name's Riri.
I'm a wizard.

237
00:11:15,508 --> 00:11:17,551
Sadly, my wand's been
out of order for a bit,

238
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:20,096
and I haven't been able to use my magic.

239
00:11:20,846 --> 00:11:22,348
Are you crazy?

240
00:11:22,848 --> 00:11:26,227
That's funny.
I was gonna ask you the same thing.

241
00:11:26,310 --> 00:11:28,312
[ominous music]

242
00:11:29,730 --> 00:11:30,648
[gasps in fear]

243
00:11:37,363 --> 00:11:41,659
[Anzu] It's kinda strange. I haven't heard
a peep from Riri since the incident.

244
00:11:42,368 --> 00:11:43,744
At last!

245
00:11:43,828 --> 00:11:48,040
[mumbling]
It's finally happening. You missed me.

246
00:11:48,124 --> 00:11:49,667
No! Did not!

247
00:11:50,209 --> 00:11:51,585
What do you want anyway?

248
00:11:51,669 --> 00:11:54,547
[Riri] I know you called.
My Anzu senses were tingling.

249
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:55,589
[giggles]

250
00:11:56,173 --> 00:11:57,049
[sighs]

251
00:11:57,800 --> 00:12:00,010
[Rio] Oh, I get it.
You were hoping to get to see…

252
00:12:01,053 --> 00:12:02,346
this version of me, huh?

253
00:12:02,430 --> 00:12:04,014
-I didn't call!
-[yelps]

254
00:12:04,098 --> 00:12:05,641
And no matter what form you're in,

255
00:12:05,724 --> 00:12:07,643
you still look like
the world's biggest piece of crap!

256
00:12:07,726 --> 00:12:09,520
Such flowery language!

257
00:12:10,438 --> 00:12:13,649
I just came to tell you
you don't have anything to worry about.

258
00:12:14,316 --> 00:12:16,444
Your troubles have all vanished!

259
00:12:16,527 --> 00:12:18,696
Now you can just focus on being you.

260
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:21,115
And don't ever change, okay?

261
00:12:23,284 --> 00:12:24,285
I love you.

262
00:12:24,869 --> 00:12:25,744
[kisses]

263
00:12:28,747 --> 00:12:32,585
-[Anzu] You bastard! Get over here!
-[Rio yelps]

264
00:12:33,544 --> 00:12:35,171
[Rio] That was close! Here you go!

265
00:12:35,254 --> 00:12:36,130
[Anzu huffs]

266
00:12:36,630 --> 00:12:39,550
[chuckles]
Well, that was fun, but I gotta go!

267
00:12:40,426 --> 00:12:42,136
Goodbye, Anzu.

268
00:12:44,472 --> 00:12:47,349
Wait! What the heck was that about?

269
00:12:47,850 --> 00:12:49,852
[birds chirping]

270
00:12:49,935 --> 00:12:52,021
[Anzu] What? She lost her memory?

271
00:12:53,022 --> 00:12:55,816
Yeah, at least
that's what her lawyer said.

272
00:12:56,358 --> 00:12:58,319
Kishi seems to have suffered
some sort of break,

273
00:12:58,402 --> 00:12:59,862
resulting in a loss of memory.

274
00:13:00,362 --> 00:13:02,406
She can't remember anything
from the past few years,

275
00:13:02,490 --> 00:13:03,616
including Tsukasa.

276
00:13:04,533 --> 00:13:06,785
Are they sure this girl isn't lying?

277
00:13:06,869 --> 00:13:08,954
[Arisa] The doctors seem to believe
it's the truth.

278
00:13:09,788 --> 00:13:11,916
Well, that's good news, then.
You should be relieved.

279
00:13:11,999 --> 00:13:14,418
You can finally go back
to living your life without fear.

280
00:13:15,127 --> 00:13:18,714
I guess. It's so sudden,
it doesn't feel real yet.

281
00:13:19,715 --> 00:13:21,550
[Anzu] Take all the time you need
to process it.

282
00:13:21,634 --> 00:13:22,635
Huh?

283
00:13:22,718 --> 00:13:23,594
[soft chuckle]

284
00:13:26,430 --> 00:13:27,348
Yeah.

285
00:13:29,183 --> 00:13:31,185
Anzu!

286
00:13:31,268 --> 00:13:32,978
-Dad! You're here!
-Ah! You're here!

287
00:13:33,687 --> 00:13:35,940
[Anzu's dad] I was worried about you,
I couldn't stay away

288
00:13:36,023 --> 00:13:38,192
while I knew my little girl
was going through such a rough time.

289
00:13:38,275 --> 00:13:41,070
Plus, check out all these sweet gifts
I brought back

290
00:13:41,153 --> 00:13:43,322
just for you to help cheer you up!

291
00:13:43,405 --> 00:13:45,282
[Anzu] Games and chocolate!

292
00:13:45,783 --> 00:13:47,201
[pig snorts]

293
00:13:47,284 --> 00:13:49,745
And don't forget the special pork buns.

294
00:13:49,828 --> 00:13:53,290
Pork buns? Hold on,
weren't they relocated to the US?

295
00:13:53,374 --> 00:13:55,501
-[Anzu's dad] And last but not least…
-[meows]

296
00:13:55,584 --> 00:13:57,169
[Anzu] Momohiki!

297
00:13:57,253 --> 00:14:00,047
Momohiki! Momohiki! Momohiki!
[smooches, exclaims]

298
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:03,300
-Missed you so much!
-[meows]

299
00:14:03,884 --> 00:14:06,720
[Anzu] Hey.
Games, chocolate, and my Momohiki?

300
00:14:06,804 --> 00:14:10,349
My three greatest desires,
all suddenly back at once?

301
00:14:10,432 --> 00:14:12,268
What the heck does this mean?

302
00:14:13,686 --> 00:14:16,480
[insects chirruping]

303
00:14:17,064 --> 00:14:19,108
[Anzu] Don't you wanna sleep
in the office with Dad?

304
00:14:19,858 --> 00:14:22,152
He snores so loudly after traveling.

305
00:14:22,236 --> 00:14:23,571
Oh.

306
00:14:23,654 --> 00:14:25,948
[snoring loudly]

307
00:14:29,034 --> 00:14:30,995
Maybe I should just go home.

308
00:14:31,871 --> 00:14:33,956
Why? Her mom said you could stay, right?

309
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:36,375
Yeah, but I don't wanna sleep
in the same room as you.

310
00:14:36,458 --> 00:14:38,127
Wow, way to sugarcoat it.

311
00:14:39,795 --> 00:14:41,505
-[Tsukasa] Hey.
-Huh?

312
00:14:42,882 --> 00:14:45,509
[Tsukasa] I have to be honest
with you about something.

313
00:14:47,219 --> 00:14:51,015
You know, uh, how I said before
that I didn't like Anzu in that way.

314
00:14:52,016 --> 00:14:53,309
Well, things have changed.

315
00:14:54,476 --> 00:14:56,395
What I'm trying to say--

316
00:14:56,478 --> 00:14:58,022
-[Junta] I know, all right?
-[gasps]

317
00:14:58,606 --> 00:14:59,607
[Tsukasa] What?

318
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:02,026
[Junta] Anzu's always been
one of the coolest people I know,

319
00:15:02,109 --> 00:15:03,944
so I can see how you'd fall for her.

320
00:15:04,445 --> 00:15:06,280
[Tsukasa] So, you're okay with it?

321
00:15:06,947 --> 00:15:10,117
Oh, wait! That means that…
[sighs]

322
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,494
[Junta] …now I have to worry
about competing with you.

323
00:15:13,078 --> 00:15:15,581
Not only that, but Ryuya as well.

324
00:15:15,664 --> 00:15:18,584
Man, you do really have
low self-esteem, don't you?

325
00:15:20,377 --> 00:15:21,962
You shouldn't worry too much.

326
00:15:22,546 --> 00:15:25,007
I only just started feeling comfortable
around her.

327
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:27,718
Plus, she only thinks of me as a friend.

328
00:15:28,218 --> 00:15:29,094
Huh?

329
00:15:30,095 --> 00:15:32,097
What? Pretty sure
you're in the friend zone too.

330
00:15:32,181 --> 00:15:34,350
Hey! You don't have to rub it in!

331
00:15:34,934 --> 00:15:38,228
Whatever. I only told you
'cause we're housemates.

332
00:15:38,896 --> 00:15:40,814
Feels weird sharing this kind of stuff.

333
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,442
Let's never talk about it again.

334
00:15:43,525 --> 00:15:44,860
It's fine by me.

335
00:15:45,444 --> 00:15:46,362
[soft chuckle]

336
00:15:47,696 --> 00:15:48,864
Hmm.

337
00:15:48,948 --> 00:15:52,576
[Anzu] I'm not sleepy at all,
so I'm just gonna go downstairs.

338
00:15:52,660 --> 00:15:54,912
[Tsukasa] I'm not tired.
I think I'll go downstairs too.

339
00:15:54,995 --> 00:15:57,331
Huh? No way. How is that fair?

340
00:15:57,414 --> 00:15:58,916
Wait up, I'm coming too.

341
00:15:59,917 --> 00:16:02,211
You've got practice
in the morning, remember?

342
00:16:02,294 --> 00:16:04,672
[Junta] There's no way
I'm leaving the two of you alone.

343
00:16:05,255 --> 00:16:07,383
I still cry just thinking
about the last time

344
00:16:07,466 --> 00:16:09,760
when you got to hug her!
[whines]

345
00:16:09,843 --> 00:16:11,679
[Tsukasa] Pull yourself together.

346
00:16:14,765 --> 00:16:17,559
Riri, explain yourself!

347
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:19,395
Get out here, right now!

348
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,108
-[Kate] I'm afraid that Riri's not coming.
-What?

349
00:16:27,194 --> 00:16:29,154
[Anzu] And, you are…

350
00:16:30,197 --> 00:16:32,241
Sorry to show up out of the blue.

351
00:16:32,324 --> 00:16:34,410
My name's Kate and I'm a wizard.

352
00:16:34,493 --> 00:16:36,829
I'm sort of the new wizard in charge.

353
00:16:36,912 --> 00:16:38,831
New wizard in charge?

354
00:16:39,873 --> 00:16:43,836
'Fraid so, since Riri's not allowed
in the human world.

355
00:16:44,837 --> 00:16:46,046
[Anzu] They're not?

356
00:16:46,130 --> 00:16:47,172
-[Junta] Anzu?
-Huh?

357
00:16:47,256 --> 00:16:48,257
-[Kate] Uh?
-[Junta gasps]

358
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:49,925
[Junta screams]
What's that?

359
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:52,428
-What's with the floating doll?
-[grumbles]

360
00:16:53,012 --> 00:16:55,889
Wait, can you guys see that thing too?

361
00:16:56,390 --> 00:16:57,558
[both] Mm-hm.

362
00:16:58,434 --> 00:17:01,353
-What is this, furball?
-[Kate] My name's Kate.

363
00:17:01,437 --> 00:17:04,481
I don't care what your name is!
Your magic's busted, fix it!

364
00:17:04,565 --> 00:17:08,360
Not again! I blew it!
I forgot to use an illusion spell!

365
00:17:08,444 --> 00:17:10,279
You're useless, you know that!

366
00:17:10,362 --> 00:17:12,698
Cut me a little slack, will ya?
[groans]

367
00:17:12,781 --> 00:17:15,159
This whole day has been
pretty hectic for me too!

368
00:17:15,242 --> 00:17:16,702
-It's talking…
-It's talking…

369
00:17:16,785 --> 00:17:19,038
[playful music]

370
00:17:19,121 --> 00:17:22,207
[Tsukasa] I don't know.
That story's pretty far-fetched,

371
00:17:22,291 --> 00:17:25,044
even with the wizard
sitting right there in front of me.

372
00:17:25,544 --> 00:17:29,173
Although when I think about it,
it actually explains a lot.

373
00:17:29,256 --> 00:17:30,090
PIERCING BRANCH

374
00:17:31,383 --> 00:17:32,676
SOAKING-WET ROOM

375
00:17:33,552 --> 00:17:37,890
So, then, our reunion
was sped up to fit its timeline?

376
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:41,685
Man, how did I not notice
something like that?

377
00:17:42,436 --> 00:17:46,273
I'm really sorry, you guys. I didn't mean
for you to get mixed up in this.

378
00:17:46,356 --> 00:17:50,235
It's so embarrassing to be
subject number one for this stupid thing.

379
00:17:50,736 --> 00:17:52,946
You've got nothing to apologize for.

380
00:17:53,739 --> 00:17:55,741
I'm sure this has been hardest on you.

381
00:17:56,366 --> 00:17:59,369
Besides, meeting you is what saved me.

382
00:17:59,870 --> 00:18:01,455
So please don't apologize.

383
00:18:01,538 --> 00:18:03,123
[Junta] I feel the same.

384
00:18:03,624 --> 00:18:06,085
I don't care how.
I'm just glad we're reunited.

385
00:18:06,585 --> 00:18:09,213
Junta, Kazuki.

386
00:18:11,173 --> 00:18:15,260
Though, I really don't like
the idea of a forced romance.

387
00:18:15,344 --> 00:18:19,181
Don't blame me. Both Riri and I
are just cogs in the corporate machine,

388
00:18:19,264 --> 00:18:20,182
just following orders.

389
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:21,975
[gasps]
Hang on.

390
00:18:22,059 --> 00:18:24,853
[Anzu] What do you mean,
they can't come back to this world?

391
00:18:24,937 --> 00:18:28,524
Riri broke the rules and used taboo magic.

392
00:18:28,607 --> 00:18:29,525
[Tsukasa] Taboo?

393
00:18:29,608 --> 00:18:32,528
[Kate] 'Fraid so. They use
their magic to erase the memories

394
00:18:32,611 --> 00:18:35,614
of Kazuki's stalker
for their own personal reasons.

395
00:18:36,156 --> 00:18:37,908
But why? Why'd they do that?

396
00:18:39,451 --> 00:18:43,413
Anzu's fault! The higher-ups thought
Riri developed feelings for Anzu

397
00:18:43,497 --> 00:18:45,165
that went beyond the professional bounds.

398
00:18:46,041 --> 00:18:49,128
[Kate] Remember when you were
attacked by those two men in the alley?

399
00:18:49,211 --> 00:18:50,921
All of your friends
just randomly showed up.

400
00:18:51,505 --> 00:18:54,675
[Anzu] Right, everyone arrived
after receiving those texts.

401
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:58,220
That interference was Riri's first strike.

402
00:18:58,303 --> 00:18:59,805
They really crossed the line.

403
00:18:59,888 --> 00:19:02,933
You see, we have very strict rules
about using our magic.

404
00:19:03,016 --> 00:19:06,520
It must be used only for the development
of romantic relationships.

405
00:19:08,105 --> 00:19:10,357
[Anzu] So, what's going to happen to Riri?

406
00:19:10,858 --> 00:19:13,068
[Kate] Capital punishment
of the magic world.

407
00:19:13,152 --> 00:19:14,444
[Anzu, Tsukasa and Junta] What?

408
00:19:15,154 --> 00:19:18,115
It's usually what would happen,
but not this time.

409
00:19:18,198 --> 00:19:19,366
The company was lenient,

410
00:19:19,449 --> 00:19:22,619
and instead, settled for a life sentence
of cleaning the basement.

411
00:19:23,370 --> 00:19:24,788
Life sentence?

412
00:19:24,872 --> 00:19:28,876
I see. So they didn't want anyone
to know about Riri's actions.

413
00:19:28,959 --> 00:19:29,960
Avoid the scandal.

414
00:19:30,043 --> 00:19:32,880
[Kate] Of course.
The company has a reputation to maintain.

415
00:19:32,963 --> 00:19:34,590
They'd agree on almost anything.

416
00:19:34,673 --> 00:19:37,009
That's how Riri was able
to negotiate getting you back

417
00:19:37,092 --> 00:19:39,219
your three greatest desires
as part of their deal.

418
00:19:39,303 --> 00:19:40,470
Any more questions?

419
00:19:40,971 --> 00:19:44,516
[Anzu] Nope, I think I understand
everything. Thanks for the insight, Kate.

420
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:47,519
Of course. I look forward
to working with you--

421
00:19:47,603 --> 00:19:48,437
[Anzu grunts]

422
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:50,522
[action music]

423
00:19:50,606 --> 00:19:55,527
[screams]

424
00:19:57,946 --> 00:19:59,114
[Kate] Hey, wait! Oh…

425
00:19:59,698 --> 00:20:03,702
What do you think you're doing?
Give me back my wand!

426
00:20:04,203 --> 00:20:06,997
You're gonna let me see Riri right now.

427
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,498
If I remember correctly,

428
00:20:08,582 --> 00:20:11,543
you can't use your magic
if your wand is contaminated.

429
00:20:12,169 --> 00:20:13,337
[Kate] You wouldn't…

430
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:16,006
[Anzu] Imagine the trouble you'll be in
when your bosses find out

431
00:20:16,089 --> 00:20:18,592
that on your first day,
you exposed yourself to humans,

432
00:20:18,675 --> 00:20:20,844
and reveal the details
of your secret mission.

433
00:20:21,428 --> 00:20:24,097
Add to that, wand contamination.

434
00:20:24,681 --> 00:20:27,392
And just so you know,
my dad's been in here tonight,

435
00:20:27,476 --> 00:20:29,853
and it wasn't pretty!

436
00:20:29,937 --> 00:20:31,396
[whimpers]

437
00:20:32,898 --> 00:20:34,024
[button clicks]

438
00:20:35,442 --> 00:20:37,861
Your little stunt cost me my bonus.

439
00:20:37,945 --> 00:20:40,948
My bosses agreed to 15 minutes
with Riri now.

440
00:20:41,615 --> 00:20:43,617
That's what I'm talking about.

441
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:46,411
Yeah, no kidding.
That's how you play hardball.

442
00:20:47,621 --> 00:20:49,456
[Kate] Stand back. I'm gonna summon Riri.

443
00:20:49,539 --> 00:20:53,418
-[magical chimes]
-Go! Roma-roma! Kira-kira!

444
00:20:53,502 --> 00:20:55,045
-[thuds]
-[groans]

445
00:20:57,673 --> 00:20:58,590
-[slaps]
-[Riri groans]

446
00:21:00,425 --> 00:21:02,427
Kate! Do you have to be so rough?

447
00:21:02,511 --> 00:21:04,221
[whimpers]
Sorry.

448
00:21:04,304 --> 00:21:06,515
-[Anzu] Riri.
-[gasps, chuckles]

449
00:21:07,099 --> 00:21:08,433
[Riri] Anzu!

450
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:10,602
Could you transform for me?

451
00:21:13,689 --> 00:21:15,774
What, what is it?

452
00:21:17,818 --> 00:21:20,529
[sighs in relief]
That's much better.

453
00:21:22,072 --> 00:21:26,451
-How dare you disappear on me like that?
-Stop, stop!

454
00:21:26,535 --> 00:21:28,495
-Let go!
-[growls]

455
00:21:30,122 --> 00:21:33,625
[Rio] You may not like it,
but everything Kate told you is true.

456
00:21:34,501 --> 00:21:38,797
This is goodbye forever. After this,
I'll never be allowed to see you again.

457
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:43,302
But hey, you'll be fine. I mean,
I was only in your way, right, Anzu?

458
00:21:44,094 --> 00:21:45,262
So…
[Rio sobs]

459
00:21:46,346 --> 00:21:47,431
[Anzu] Thank you.

460
00:21:47,514 --> 00:21:48,473
[gasps]

461
00:21:50,267 --> 00:21:53,603
Seriously, you left
before I could say it, moron.

462
00:21:54,771 --> 00:21:58,400
I'm sure an ordinary heroine
would have said that with more poise.

463
00:22:00,152 --> 00:22:03,155
Too bad for you,
I'll always be an Anti-Heroine.

464
00:22:04,323 --> 00:22:06,491
[Tsukasa] You know,
she's not the only one.

465
00:22:07,075 --> 00:22:08,285
Thank you, Rio.

466
00:22:09,786 --> 00:22:12,039
Kazuki, no. You and Anzu,

467
00:22:13,165 --> 00:22:16,335
you guys shouldn't thank me for anything.

468
00:22:16,835 --> 00:22:18,211
I messed up.

469
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:21,214
I broke the rules and ruined everything.

470
00:22:22,758 --> 00:22:25,344
And now that you've got
your three greatest desires back,

471
00:22:25,886 --> 00:22:28,680
you can just forget about me,
like a bad dream.

472
00:22:29,431 --> 00:22:30,557
Are you dense?

473
00:22:31,933 --> 00:22:35,854
That's nuts! Do you really think
I'd choose things over my friends?

474
00:22:36,438 --> 00:22:38,732
Never! I would never forget about you.

475
00:22:38,815 --> 00:22:40,358
So what is it you want?

476
00:22:40,859 --> 00:22:41,818
Huh?

477
00:22:42,319 --> 00:22:45,322
[Anzu] I'm asking you, Riri,
what do you want to do?

478
00:22:45,947 --> 00:22:46,823
[Rio] Uh…

479
00:22:48,742 --> 00:22:50,577
Anzu, what I want…

480
00:22:51,244 --> 00:22:52,120
[Rio sobs]

481
00:22:52,704 --> 00:22:53,747
…is to be…

482
00:22:54,706 --> 00:22:56,041
here by your side!

483
00:22:57,459 --> 00:22:58,335
[soft chuckle]

484
00:22:59,044 --> 00:23:01,588
Then stay with me. It's that easy.

485
00:23:01,671 --> 00:23:03,673
[tender music]

486
00:23:04,424 --> 00:23:05,342
[Rio] Okay.

487
00:23:07,886 --> 00:23:11,723
Oh, Anzu!
[cries]

488
00:23:11,807 --> 00:23:13,975
[crying continues]

489
00:23:14,059 --> 00:23:17,062
[Kate] So, hey, um,
are you guys almost done here?

490
00:23:17,145 --> 00:23:19,147
'Cause we really need to wrap this up.

491
00:23:19,856 --> 00:23:22,150
Hey, Furball! Read the room!

492
00:23:22,234 --> 00:23:24,736
[Kate] I told you I'm Kate, not Furball!

493
00:23:24,820 --> 00:23:26,154
Whatever!

494
00:23:26,238 --> 00:23:31,243
Besides, Riri's not going anywhere.
Use your magic so they can stay for good.

495
00:23:31,743 --> 00:23:34,913
I can't do that!
Like I said, magic can only be used…

496
00:23:34,996 --> 00:23:38,250
[both] …if it contributes
to any romantic relationships!

497
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:40,794
That's right. Finally, she gets it.

498
00:23:40,877 --> 00:23:41,962
[Anzu] Well.

499
00:23:42,504 --> 00:23:46,466
What if I told you there's
a 0.00001 percent chance

500
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:49,261
that I'd fall for Rio,
making him my potential mate?

501
00:23:50,053 --> 00:23:53,181
Rio? Wait! Oh…

502
00:23:53,765 --> 00:23:55,267
[Junta and Tsukasa] Anzu?

503
00:23:56,893 --> 00:23:59,855
As the wizard in charge,
you're making sure that I fall in love.

504
00:23:59,938 --> 00:24:02,190
You can't separate me
from a potential mate.

505
00:24:02,274 --> 00:24:04,484
-That'll break some rules, right?
-[Rio groans]

506
00:24:05,068 --> 00:24:07,320
-[Anzu] Therefore…
-[whimpers]

507
00:24:08,321 --> 00:24:13,368
It's completely and totally legal for you
to use your magic to keep Rio here!

508
00:24:13,451 --> 00:24:14,786
-Wow.
-Whoa.

509
00:24:15,287 --> 00:24:16,872
What?

510
00:24:16,955 --> 00:24:18,373
Okay, fine then.

511
00:24:18,456 --> 00:24:22,085
This is bad. I'm gonna get
such a pay cut for this.

512
00:24:23,253 --> 00:24:25,630
-You really are the queen of debate!
-[chuckles mischievously]

513
00:24:26,131 --> 00:24:28,967
[Anzu] Huh. Don't go getting
the wrong idea or anything.

514
00:24:29,050 --> 00:24:32,429
I'm not cooperating with your project
and I'm not losing this game.

515
00:24:34,055 --> 00:24:35,807
[gasps]
Neither am I.

516
00:24:36,308 --> 00:24:38,393
I won't lose! Bring it on!

517
00:24:40,562 --> 00:24:44,191
[Anzu] Once things calmed down,
my parents left again to go back to work.

518
00:24:45,775 --> 00:24:48,695
[yawns]
I'm sleepy.

519
00:24:48,778 --> 00:24:51,198
I was up way too late playing games.

520
00:24:51,281 --> 00:24:54,075
[Anzu] And the three of us
continued living together.

521
00:24:54,993 --> 00:24:57,871
The boss was nearly impossible to beat.

522
00:24:57,954 --> 00:24:59,206
Don't fall asleep. You'll trip.

523
00:24:59,789 --> 00:25:00,707
[Anzu] Yeah, yeah.

524
00:25:00,790 --> 00:25:03,084
[Junta] Leave it to Anzu
to sleepwalk to school.

525
00:25:04,419 --> 00:25:05,545
Huh?

526
00:25:06,463 --> 00:25:08,632
[Hijiri] Good morning, my fellow students.

527
00:25:09,633 --> 00:25:11,468
The new semester begins.

528
00:25:11,551 --> 00:25:15,055
It must be a treat for you three
to get to be in my presence daily.

529
00:25:15,138 --> 00:25:15,972
Huh?

530
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:20,018
We're just so grateful. You're a delight.

531
00:25:20,101 --> 00:25:22,729
By the way,
thanks for pulling some strings.

532
00:25:22,812 --> 00:25:25,148
-Now Kishi's family will stop--
-Who told you that?

533
00:25:25,232 --> 00:25:26,066
Tsuchiya.

534
00:25:26,566 --> 00:25:28,485
Mm-mm. Mm-mm. Mm-mm. Mm-mm…

535
00:25:29,069 --> 00:25:31,738
[Anzu] It's admirable to do
such a good deed without showing off.

536
00:25:31,821 --> 00:25:35,075
I-- I don't care
what you plebs think of me.

537
00:25:35,158 --> 00:25:36,993
Again with this hot and cold act?

538
00:25:43,166 --> 00:25:45,794
I don't know
if I've said this before, but,

539
00:25:45,877 --> 00:25:49,422
I really appreciate our time together
on these walks to school.

540
00:25:49,506 --> 00:25:50,590
What?

541
00:25:50,674 --> 00:25:52,676
Uh, wait, did that sound weird?

542
00:25:53,176 --> 00:25:55,095
Not at all. It's very sweet.

543
00:25:55,178 --> 00:25:58,181
-[chuckles awkwardly]
-[Tsukasa] Could he be any more obvious?

544
00:25:59,182 --> 00:26:02,477
[Anzu] I suppose I don't have
to actively avoid romance anymore,

545
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:05,647
since I did get
all of my things back, right?

546
00:26:05,730 --> 00:26:08,066
-[Riri] Good morning!
-Huh?

547
00:26:08,608 --> 00:26:10,860
-[Riri laughs happily]
-[Anzu] What? She's back?

548
00:26:13,321 --> 00:26:14,155
[Anzu groans]

549
00:26:14,239 --> 00:26:16,032
I'm here to tell you about the new rules.

550
00:26:16,533 --> 00:26:18,034
The new rules?

551
00:26:18,618 --> 00:26:22,998
Yep! You see, your games, chocolate,
and cat may have been returned for now,

552
00:26:23,581 --> 00:26:26,710
but, unless you start prioritizing
romantic relationships,

553
00:26:27,210 --> 00:26:29,462
you'll lose them all again!

554
00:26:29,546 --> 00:26:32,882
Not fair! It's like facing the final boss
with level one weapon.

555
00:26:32,966 --> 00:26:34,009
That's bad, right?

556
00:26:34,092 --> 00:26:35,760
And if you finish high school

557
00:26:35,844 --> 00:26:37,470
and you're still alone,

558
00:26:37,554 --> 00:26:40,473
well, then they'll be confiscated forever!

559
00:26:40,557 --> 00:26:42,434
[growls]
What?

560
00:26:43,143 --> 00:26:46,771
I told you before,
I will not be forced into a relationship!

561
00:26:47,272 --> 00:26:50,775
You'll see! I will not lose,
I'll win this project!

562
00:26:50,859 --> 00:26:53,903
Ah! Anzu, you're so bold, I love it!

563
00:26:54,529 --> 00:26:56,072
And let's not forget, you two,

564
00:26:56,156 --> 00:26:59,242
that there's still a possibility
that Anzu ends up with me!

565
00:26:59,326 --> 00:27:01,911
[giggles]
So, don't take it personally, okay?

566
00:27:01,995 --> 00:27:04,289
You've done good but my kiss
is hard to compete with,

567
00:27:04,372 --> 00:27:05,707
plus we've already kissed twice.

568
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:07,792
[in deep voice]
Do something about your mouth,

569
00:27:07,876 --> 00:27:09,002
-or I will.
-[babbling]

570
00:27:09,085 --> 00:27:12,630
Oh! Right here in front of everyone?
Are you sure?

571
00:27:12,714 --> 00:27:15,133
[Anzu] Knock it off! You know what I mean!

572
00:27:15,216 --> 00:27:17,052
[Riri] You're blushing!
Are you embarrassed?

573
00:27:17,135 --> 00:27:18,511
[Anzu] I'm not blushing!

574
00:27:19,429 --> 00:27:22,349
MEDICAL CENTER

575
00:27:22,432 --> 00:27:25,352
My next subject
should be around here somewhere.

576
00:27:26,353 --> 00:27:27,937
-[wand beeping]
-Oh, there she is.

577
00:27:28,980 --> 00:27:31,733
[Kate] Hopefully
she's not as difficult to work with.

578
00:27:34,694 --> 00:27:36,696
[theme music]

579
00:28:04,724 --> 00:28:08,895
[Riri] Anzu's wonderful
and oh, so romantic developments

580
00:28:08,978 --> 00:28:12,941
are slowly progressing as we speak.
[chuckles]
